function d({registerIndicator:y,sourceValues:g,nulls:h}){y({id:"oa-cg",name:"Center of Gravity (CG)",category:"Cycles",placement:"pane",inputs:[{key:"length",type:"number",label:"Length",default:10,min:1,max:2e3,step:1,tooltip:"Period for Center of Gravity calculation"},{key:"source",type:"source",label:"Source",default:"close"}],plots:[{key:"cg",type:"line",title:"CG",style:{color:"#ffeb3b",lineWidth:2}}],levels:()=>[{price:0,title:"Zero Line",color:"#9598a1",dashed:!0}],calc(l,c){const r=Math.max(1,Math.floor(Number(c.length)||10)),i=g(l,c.source??"close"),a=(r+1)/2,s=new Array(l.length).fill(NaN);for(let e=0;e<l.length;e++){let u=0,o=0;for(let t=1;t<=r;t++){const n=e-(t-1),p=n>=0&&Number.isFinite(i[n])?i[n]:0;u+=t*p,o+=p}const f=(o!==0?u/o:a)-a;Number.isFinite(f)&&(s[e]=f)}return{cg:h(s)}}})}export{d as default};
